#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Your privacy matters. This policy explains how Nocturne handles your data and protects your privacy."
msgstr "Your privacy matters. This policy explains how Nocturne handles your data and protects your privacy."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
#: src/routes/(legal)/terms/+page.svelte
msgid "1. Introduction"
msgstr "1. Introduction"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Nocturne is a self-hosted, open-source diabetes data management platform. This means <0>you control where your data lives</0>. Unlike cloud-based services, Nocturne runs on your own server or hosting provider, and your data stays in your own database."
msgstr "Nocturne is a self-hosted, open-source diabetes data management platform. This means <0>you control where your data lives</0>. Unlike cloud-based services, Nocturne runs on your own server or hosting provider, and your data stays in your own database."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "This privacy policy explains what data Nocturne collects (spoiler: very little), how it's stored, and your rights."
msgstr "This privacy policy explains what data Nocturne collects (spoiler: very little), how it's stored, and your rights."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "2. Data We DON'T Collect"
msgstr "2. Data We DON'T Collect"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Because Nocturne is self-hosted, we (the Nocturne project developers) do not have access to your data. Specifically:"
msgstr "Because Nocturne is self-hosted, we (the Nocturne project developers) do not have access to your data. Specifically:"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>No analytics:</0> Nocturne does not send usage analytics or telemetry to us by default."
msgstr "<0>No analytics:</0> Nocturne does not send usage analytics or telemetry to us by default."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>No tracking:</0> We don't track your usage, browsing, or behavior."
msgstr "<0>No tracking:</0> We don't track your usage, browsing, or behavior."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>No data collection:</0> Your glucose readings, treatments, meals, and health data never leave your server unless you choose to share them."
msgstr "<0>No data collection:</0> Your glucose readings, treatments, meals, and health data never leave your server unless you choose to share them."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>No selling data:</0> We don't sell your data because we don't have access to it in the first place."
msgstr "<0>No selling data:</0> We don't sell your data because we don't have access to it in the first place."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>No cloud storage:</0> Nocturne doesn't store your data in our cloud or servers. It's all on your infrastructure."
msgstr "<0>No cloud storage:</0> Nocturne doesn't store your data in our cloud or servers. It's all on your infrastructure."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "3. Data Storage"
msgstr "3. Data Storage"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "All your Nocturne data is stored in your own database on your own server or hosting provider. This includes:"
msgstr "All your Nocturne data is stored in your own database on your own server or hosting provider. This includes:"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Glucose readings (blood sugar, CGM data)"
msgstr "Glucose readings (blood sugar, CGM data)"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Treatments (insulin, medications)"
msgstr "Treatments (insulin, medications)"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Meals and nutrition data"
msgstr "Meals and nutrition data"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Activity and exercise logs"
msgstr "Activity and exercise logs"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "User account information"
msgstr "User account information"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Settings and preferences"
msgstr "Settings and preferences"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Where your data lives:"
msgstr "Where your data lives:"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>Your database:</0> All persistent data is stored in a PostgreSQL database that you control."
msgstr "<0>Your database:</0> All persistent data is stored in a PostgreSQL database that you control."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>Your hosting provider:</0> Your hosting provider's privacy policy and security practices apply to your data. Choose a provider you trust."
msgstr "<0>Your hosting provider:</0> Your hosting provider's privacy policy and security practices apply to your data. Choose a provider you trust."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>Browser local storage:</0> Some temporary data (like UI preferences) may be stored in your browser's local storage. This never leaves your device."
msgstr "<0>Browser local storage:</0> Some temporary data (like UI preferences) may be stored in your browser's local storage. This never leaves your device."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "4. Third-Party Services and Connectors"
msgstr "4. Third-Party Services and Connectors"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Nocturne can connect to third-party diabetes data services to import your glucose and treatment data. When you use these integrations:"
msgstr "Nocturne can connect to third-party diabetes data services to import your glucose and treatment data. When you use these integrations:"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>Third-party privacy policies apply:</0> Services like Dexcom, FreeStyle Libre, Glooko, and Tidepool have their own privacy policies. Review them before connecting."
msgstr "<0>Third-party privacy policies apply:</0> Services like Dexcom, FreeStyle Libre, Glooko, and Tidepool have their own privacy policies. Review them before connecting."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>We don't control third parties:</0> We cannot control what data these services collect about you or how they use it."
msgstr "<0>We don't control third parties:</0> We cannot control what data these services collect about you or how they use it."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>Credentials storage:</0> Your API keys and login credentials for third-party services are stored <1>encrypted</1> in your database. Only your Nocturne instance can decrypt them."
msgstr "<0>Credentials storage:</0> Your API keys and login credentials for third-party services are stored <1>encrypted</1> in your database. Only your Nocturne instance can decrypt them."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "<0>Data transfer:</0> When you connect to a third-party service, data flows between that service and your Nocturne instance. We (the Nocturne developers) do not see or have access to this data."
msgstr "<0>Data transfer:</0> When you connect to a third-party service, data flows between that service and your Nocturne instance. We (the Nocturne developers) do not see or have access to this data."

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Third-party services you might connect:"
msgstr "Third-party services you might connect:"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Dexcom (CGM data)"
msgstr "Dexcom (CGM data)"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "FreeStyle Libre (CGM data)"
msgstr "FreeStyle Libre (CGM data)"

#: src/routes/(legal)/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Glooko (multi-source data aggregation)"
msgstr "Glooko (multi-source data aggregation)"

